The failed test shows the existing donor was not matched. My best explanation is that `getOrgDefaults()` returns an empty, unsaved settings record when the org has no stored Data Import settings, as in a test context. All matching fields are then blank and BDI creates a new contact. I have not compiled or run this version.

The fix is to fill in only the blank fields with the standard defaults and leave any values already set in the org alone. Those defaults match contacts on first name, last name and email, and never match existing donations.

